<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />

    <title>OrbitMedia | Fast & Secure Document Delivery — Powered by OrbitRMS</title>

    <!-- Primary Meta -->
    <meta name="title" content="OrbitMedia | Fast & Secure Document Delivery — Powered by OrbitRMS" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="OrbitMedia is a fast, lightweight, and secure document delivery service powered by OrbitRMS. Stream files instantly in any browser — no plugins required." />
    <meta name="keywords" content="OrbitRMS, OrbitMedia, Document Delivery, Secure File Streaming, RMS Platform" />
    <meta name="author" content="OrbitRMS" />

    <!-- Favicon -->
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/images/favicon/favicon.ico" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/images/favicon/favicon-16x16.png" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/images/favicon/favicon-32x32.png" />

    <!-- Apple -->
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/images/favicon/apple-touch-icon.png" />

    <!-- Android -->
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="192x192" href="/images/favicon/android-chrome-192x192.png" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="512x512" href="/images/favicon/android-chrome-512x512.png" />

    <!-- Open Graph / Facebook -->
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="OrbitMedia — Powered by OrbitRMS" />
    <meta
      property="og:description"
      content="Secure and instant document streaming powered by OrbitRMS. Lightweight, reliable, and built for modern browsers." />
    <meta property="og:image" content="/images/open-graph-image.png" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://orbit-media-service-staging.vercel.app/" />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="OrbitMedia" />

    <!-- Twitter -->
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="OrbitMedia — Powered by OrbitRMS" />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="Fast and secure document streaming powered by OrbitRMS." />
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="/images/open-graph-image.png" />

    <!-- Fonts -->
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=Sora:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      :root {
        --gold: #c17f3a;
        --gold-light: #d4973f;
        --gold-glow: rgba(193, 127, 58, 0.15);
        --ink: #1a1816;
        --ink-mid: #4a4845;
        --ink-soft: #6b6760;
        --ink-muted: #a09d98;
        --border: rgba(193, 127, 58, 0.12);
        --border-soft: #ede9e2;
        --bg: #faf9f7;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      body {
        font-family: "Sora", sans-serif;
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--ink);
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 60px 24px 48px;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }

      /* Fine grain texture */
      body::before {
        content: "";
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.85' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='0.03'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 0;
      }

      /* Ambient radial glow */
      body::after {
        content: "";
        position: fixed;
        top: -20%;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        width: 800px;
        height: 500px;
        background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(193, 127, 58, 0.06) 0%, transparent 70%);
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 0;
      }

      .wrap {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        max-width: 620px;
        width: 100%;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .logo-wrapper {
        padding-bottom: 40px;
      }

      /* ── Logo ── */
      .logo-mark {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 64px;
        height: 64px;
        position: relative;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }

      .ring {
        position: absolute;
        border-radius: 50%;
      }
      .ring-1 {
        width: 64px;
        height: 64px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(193, 127, 58, 0.25);
        animation: spin-slow 20s linear infinite;
      }
      .ring-2 {
        width: 44px;
        height: 44px;
        border: 1px dashed rgba(193, 127, 58, 0.18);
        animation: spin-slow 14s linear infinite reverse;
      }
      .ring-3 {
        width: 26px;
        height: 26px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(193, 127, 58, 0.12);
      }

      @keyframes spin-slow {
        from {
          transform: rotate(0deg);
        }
        to {
          transform: rotate(360deg);
        }
      }

      .orbit-dot {
        width: 9px;
        height: 9px;
        background: var(--gold);
        border-radius: 50%;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        box-shadow:
          0 0 0 3px rgba(193, 127, 58, 0.15),
          0 0 16px rgba(193, 127, 58, 0.3);
        animation: breathe 3s ease-in-out infinite;
      }

      @keyframes breathe {
        0%,
        100% {
          box-shadow:
            0 0 0 3px rgba(193, 127, 58, 0.15),
            0 0 12px rgba(193, 127, 58, 0.25);
        }
        50% {
          box-shadow:
            0 0 0 6px rgba(193, 127, 58, 0.08),
            0 0 24px rgba(193, 127, 58, 0.4);
        }
      }

      /* ── Wordmark ── */
      .wordmark {
        font-size: 11px;
        letter-spacing: 0.2em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        font-weight: 400;
        margin-bottom: 48px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .wordmark strong {
        color: var(--gold);
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      .wordmark-sep {
        width: 24px;
        height: 1px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--border-soft), transparent);
      }

      /* ── Headline ── */
      h1 {
        font-family: "Instrument Serif", serif;
        font-size: clamp(40px, 9vw, 62px);
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 1.08;
        color: var(--ink);
        margin-bottom: 28px;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }

      h1 em {
        font-style: italic;
        color: var(--ink-soft);
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--ink-mid) 0%, var(--gold) 100%);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        background-clip: text;
      }

      /* ── Cards ── */
      .cards {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 1px;
        background: var(--border-soft);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
        margin: 36px 0;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .card {
        background: var(--bg);
        padding: 28px 24px;
        text-align: left;
        position: relative;
        transition: background 0.25s ease;
      }

      .card:hover {
        background: #ffffff;
      }

      .card-icon {
        width: 32px;
        height: 32px;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .card-icon svg {
        width: 20px;
        height: 20px;
        stroke: var(--gold);
        fill: none;
        stroke-width: 1.5;
        stroke-linecap: round;
        stroke-linejoin: round;
      }

      .card-title {
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--ink);
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .card-body {
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: var(--ink-soft);
        font-weight: 300;
      }

      /* ── Prose ── */
      .prose {
        margin: 0 0 12px;
      }

      .prose p {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.85;
        font-weight: 300;
        color: var(--ink-soft);
        margin-bottom: 14px;
      }

      .prose p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      /* ── Stats row ── */
      .stats {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0;
        margin: 36px 0;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .stat {
        flex: 1;
        padding: 24px 16px;
        border-right: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
        position: relative;
      }
      .stat:last-child {
        border-right: none;
      }

      .stat-number {
        font-family: "Instrument Serif", serif;
        font-size: 30px;
        font-weight: 400;
        color: var(--ink);
        line-height: 1;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }

      .stat-number em {
        font-style: italic;
        color: var(--gold);
      }

      .stat-label {
        font-size: 10px;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        font-weight: 400;
      }

      /* ── Powered by ── */
      .powered {
        margin-top: 44px;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: stretch;
        gap: 12px;
        padding: 12px 22px;
        font-size: 11px;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        transition:
          border-color 0.2s ease,
          box-shadow 0.2s ease;
      }
      .powered span {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .powered:hover {
        border-color: rgba(193, 127, 58, 0.3);
        box-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(193, 127, 58, 0.08);
      }

      .powered-sep {
        width: 1px;
        height: 30px;
        background: var(--border-soft);
      }
      .powered strong {
        color: var(--ink);
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      }

      /* ── Footer ── */
      .footer {
        margin-top: 36px;
        font-size: 11px;
        color: #c8c4bc;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .footer-dot {
        width: 3px;
        height: 3px;
        background: #d8d5cf;
        border-radius: 50%;
      }

      /* ── Tag chip ── */
      .tag {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 10px;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--gold);
        border: 1px solid rgba(193, 127, 58, 0.25);
        padding: 4px 12px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        font-weight: 500;
        background: rgba(193, 127, 58, 0.04);
      }

      /* ── Animate in ── */
      @keyframes fadeUp {
        from {
          opacity: 0;
          transform: translateY(20px);
        }
        to {
          opacity: 1;
          transform: translateY(0);
        }
      }

      .logo-mark {
        animation: fadeUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.9, 0.36, 1) 0s both;
      }
      .wordmark {
        animation: fadeUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.9, 0.36, 1) 0.1s both;
      }
      .tag {
        animation: fadeUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.9, 0.36, 1) 0.15s both;
      }
      h1 {
        animation: fadeUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.9, 0.36, 1) 0.22s both;
      }
      .cards {
        animation: fadeUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.9, 0.36, 1) 0.3s both;
      }
      .prose {
        animation: fadeUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.9, 0.36, 1) 0.38s both;
      }
      .stats {
        animation: fadeUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.9, 0.36, 1) 0.44s both;
      }
      .powered {
        animation: fadeUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.9, 0.36, 1) 0.52s both;
      }
      .footer {
        animation: fadeUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.9, 0.36, 1) 0.6s both;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="logo-wrapper">
        <img src="/images/orbitmedia-logo-transperent.png" width="150" height="50" alt="OrbitMEDIA Service Logo" />
      </div>
      <div class="tag">Media Microservice</div>

      <h1>Secure document<br /><em>streaming, simplified.</em></h1>

      <!-- Feature cards -->
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-title">Secure Delivery</div>
          <div class="card-body">End-to-end encrypted streaming with zero third-party exposure.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
              <path d="M12 8v4l3 3" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-title">Always On</div>
          <div class="card-body">Lightweight, high-performance architecture built for reliability.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" />
              <path d="M3 9h18M9 21V9" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-title">No Plugins</div>
          <div class="card-body">Renders PDFs natively in any modern browser — no friction.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path
                d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-title">Inbuilt-First</div>
          <div class="card-body">Minimal external dependencies. Controlled, scalable, internal.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Prose -->
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          <strong style="color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500">OrbitMedia</strong> is the dedicated media service of
          OrbitRMS — built as a lightweight, high-performance microservice that handles secure document delivery across
          the platform.
        </p>
        <p>
          Whenever you open a PDF or media file inside OrbitRMS, the request is seamlessly redirected here. Think of
          OrbitMedia as the engine between your documents and your audience — clean, reliable, and always on.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Stats -->
      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-number">0<em>ms</em></div>
          <div class="stat-label">Plugin overhead</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-number"><em>∞</em></div>
          <div class="stat-label">Browser support</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-number">1<em>st</em></div>
          <div class="stat-label">Inbuilt-first</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="powered">
        <span>Powered by</span>
        <div class="powered-sep"></div>
        <img src="/images/orbitrms-final-logo-transperent.webp" width="80" height="35" alt="OrbitRMS Logo" />
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <span>media.orbitrms.com</span>
        <span class="footer-dot"></span>
        <span>© 2025 OrbitRMS</span>
        <span class="footer-dot"></span>
        <span>All rights reserved</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
